Hail and well met! This guide is intended to help players looking to hunt in solo/group Fear break the zone. This may be a paradigm shift for you, dear reader; the Plane of Fear, without player administration, is not safe. To rectify this unfortunate situation, I'm compiling a list of techniques, methods, and understandings that you will need to successfully hunt in the Plane of Fear.

Do note that you should be in the difficulty and mode of zone that you are prepared for; this guide is meaningless for a fresh level 46 solo play if you're in a D4 multiplayer instance. Be honest about the level difficulty you should be attempting and you'll find the guide here will always apply.

